{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Yurei Hunt</strong> \u2013 A Supernatural Prop Hunt Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yurei Hunt is a multiplayer prop hunt game set in a world of haunted, mystical locations. Play as a Yurei, a ghost that can possess almost any object to hide, trick, and escape, or as a Hunter, searching for spirits disguised in plain sight. Each map is filled with interactive elements that both sides can use to outsmart each other, making every round a thrilling mix of strategy, deception, and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immerse yourself in the haunting atmosphere of <i>Yurei Hunt</i> with real-time proximity voice chat!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Communicate with your teammates and strategize, but beware\u2014your voice travels just like in real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The closer you are to someone, the clearer they hear you. As you move away, your voice fades into the eerie silence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ghosts can whisper... or taunt!</strong> Hunters and ghosts alike can use voice chat, making every round an intense mind game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the tension rise as you hear distant whispers in the dark\u2014was that your teammate... or something else?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay silent, stay hidden... or risk being heard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Environments &amp; Evolving Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore diverse maps inspired by eerie <strong>traditional Japanese locations</strong> and <strong>futuristic cyberpunk cityscapes</strong>. From <strong>cursed shrines</strong> cloaked in mist to <strong>neon-lit streets</strong> pulsing with energy, every setting offers <strong>unique ways to outmaneuver</strong> your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0f <strong>Diverse Maps</strong> \u2013 Haunted shrines, dense forests, cyberpunk streets, and more, each designed for mind games and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Tactical Abilities &amp; Deception</strong> \u2013 As a Yurei you can turn into almost any object in the map and you can manipulate your surroundings, creating illusions and using darkness to evade capture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/abilities_1_1.gif?t=1743287903\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Multiplayer\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Play with up to <strong>8 players</strong>, competing with friends or online opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Weather:</strong> Thick fog, sudden snow, or lightning strikes can change visibility and create new strategies for both Yurei and Hunters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/dynamic_weather_1_1.gif?t=1743287903\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic World Elements:</strong> Each map features unique interactive elements that shape the game. Turn off streetlights with switches to cloak Yurei in darkness, or extinguish lanterns in shrines for a stealthy escape. From flickering neon signs to creaky doors, every environment offers new ways to hide, hunt, and manipulate the shadows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/map-Elements_1.gif?t=1743287903\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 <strong>Advanced Graphics &amp; Performance</strong> \u2013 Powered by <strong>Unreal Engine\u2019s latest technology</strong>, with <strong>Nvidia DLSS</strong> ensuring <strong>smooth, high-performance gameplay</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you become <strong>the hunter</strong> or <strong>the hunted</strong>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505800?t=1743287903","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505800?t=1743287903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/9b245860c6d36be534d38de74d2d2ced288edb28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743287903","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/9b245860c6d36be534d38de74d2d2ced288edb28/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743287903","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Yurei Hunt</strong> \u2013 A Supernatural Prop Hunt Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yurei Hunt is a multiplayer prop hunt game set in a world of haunted, mystical locations. Play as a Yurei, a ghost that can possess almost any object to hide, trick, and escape, or as a Hunter, searching for spirits disguised in plain sight. Each map is filled with interactive elements that both sides can use to outsmart each other, making every round a thrilling mix of strategy, deception, and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"